#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:78
msgid ""
"Closing a connected tab asks once instead of twice; cancelling no longer "
"leaves a session running with no tab"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:79
msgid "Quitting can be confirmed with the same \"Don't ask me again\" option"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:80
msgid ""
"If the app crashes or is killed, its SSH sessions, forwards and transfers "
"now stop with it instead of running on unreachable"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:81
msgid ""
"Detach and restore-sessions-on-startup are retired: detached sessions could "
"never be reopened, and restore never covered a crash"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:82
msgid ""
"Settings: Interface is now General and holds Ask before closing a tab and "
"Ask before quitting; Background Service moves to Advanced and shows the real "
"idle shutdown time"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:83
msgid ""
"The About dialog shows the bundled app icon, not an outdated system copy"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:84
msgid "Spanish: \"Close\" now reads \"Cerrar\""
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:89
msgid ""
"Saved hosts now connect exactly as `ssh <alias>` does in a terminal: earlier "
"Host * and Match blocks, /etc/ssh/ssh_config and the main config of hosts in "
"included files all apply as OpenSSH applies them"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:90
msgid ""
"If a setting you typed is no longer the one used, a banner in the main "
"window says so and the connection editor marks the field with the value that "
"wins and where it comes from; open Effective Config for details"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:91
msgid ""
"Saved passwords are looked up by the user and host OpenSSH resolves, so a "
"Host * that changes User or HostName may ask for the password once more"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:92
msgid ""
"The app keepalive is now only a fallback; a ServerAliveInterval in your SSH "
"config wins"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:93
msgid ""
"Host key checking is left to your SSH config unless you set it in Settings"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:94
msgid ""
"Settings > SSH Options is now a page of overrides that win over the SSH "
"config, with Not set by default, keyword suggestions, an address family "
"option, a legacy device compatibility switch and free-form extra options"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:95
msgid ""
"Clear messages when the SSH config cannot be read, is read-only, is a link "
"the app cannot see, or is rejected by OpenSSH; no more .bak copy beside it"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.mfat.sshpilot.metainfo.xml.in:96
msgid "A linked ~/.ssh/config is followed the way OpenSSH does"
msgstr ""

